# 🚩 Challenge: [vault-door-6]
![alt text](vault-door-6.png)
## 📝 Challenge Description
This vault uses an XOR encryption scheme. The source code for this vault is here: VaultDoor6.java

Hints
1. If X ^ Y = Z, then Z ^ Y = X. Write a program that decrypts the flag based on this fact.
---

### Code / Terminal Snippets
```bash
1. wget https://challenge-files.cylabacademy.net/library/1aeb070229259c18f9b2c9f1d0982f8dab37c7547526f8d55288a5a8bb856e2d/VaultDoor6.java
